Updated to 3d47d9a4207933c9d6ada195cf39bd2278e575d9. The three review findings are fixed with boundary regressions: revoked or malformed explicit models fail visibly, and contradictory agent/session targets are refused while legacy main-session aliases retain their behavior.

The repair also preserves scheduled model/fallback precedence and separates turn-local account selection from saved conversation pins. Independently recorded job accounts retain their existing authorization checks and work when an unrelated destination account is unavailable. Focused tests and affected static checks pass; committed-branch review is scoped-clean. The PR body records the proof, costs, and limits. Exact-head CI is running in 39508097052.

